summary:
  A first segment named like the station is cut even when it does not read as a station.

history:
  That was the rule on 2026-11-02, and a station named after an artist lost
  the artist: "Bob Marley & The Wailers - One Love - Exodus" on "Bob Marley
  Radio" read as "Exodus" by "One Love", and "Queen" went on "Queen -
  Greatest Hits".

target:
  package/contents/ui/TrackLogic.js

find:
      if (a === "" || b === "" || !_stationWord(seg)) return false;

replace:
      if (a === "" || b === "") return false;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_tracklogic.qml::test_an_artist_in_front_is_never_taken_for_the_station.
  Line-neutral.
